+*<hdrCalibration><output name="..." displayId="..." black="..." peak="..." fullFrame="..." white="..." />*
+	Per-output HDR luminance setup, normally written by HDR Calibration. The
+	16-digit hexadecimal displayId must match the connected monitor's EDID
